    "title": "MRA shuts down Simpson Academy to win MAIS Overall State championship - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago MRA found redemption in the MAIS Overall State title game on Tuesday night, defeating Simpson Academy in a 37-25 defensive slugfest. It is the first state title for MRA since 2023 and after falling in the MAIS Overall State finals the last two years, the Lady Patriots used those losses to grow and learn to make sure that they did not let another chance slip away. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
